description	"Armored Ninja

^2Weaponry:
- Naginata
-- ^1Red ^7/ ^6Purple ^7Styles
-- Melee / Ranged Defense (1)

^8Attributes:
- BP Free Jumps
- Heavy Armor [Cortosis 1, Blast Armour]

In some cases, the ninja would adorn themself in heavy armor. This wasn't useful for being stealthy but aided in large confrontations. The naginata, which was a polearm that kept the user at a distance."